WEBVTT

00:04:28.597 --> 00:04:30.182
I knew what I had to do.

00:04:30.516 --> 00:04:32.226
I knew I had to leave.

00:04:32.601 --> 00:04:34.395
I knew I was afraid,

00:04:34.437 --> 00:04:36.355
but I did it anyways.

00:04:36.355 --> 00:04:38.316
I wrote an op-ed in "The New York Times"

00:04:38.316 --> 00:04:41.027
calling out Nike's maternity policy,

00:04:41.068 --> 00:04:42.528
and I wasn't the only one.

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:49.368
(Applause)

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:52.163
My teammates and I,
we helped turn the tide.

00:04:52.455 --> 00:04:56.208
Now, Nike offers eighteen months
maternity protection

00:04:56.208 --> 00:04:57.668
and other sponsors --

00:04:57.668 --> 00:05:00.004
(Applause)